0], [1329.0, 768.0], [1329.0, 798.0], [176.0, 799.0]], 'led by Lead Investigators (Professor Daniel Martin and Mr Paul Mouncey). Meeting of the TMG', 0.9950731311525617], [[[176.0, 800.0], [1259.0, 800.0], [1259.0, 833.0], [176.0, 833.0]], 'will be held quarterly, or more frequently during key stages of the trial, to ensure effective', 0.9938338760365831], [[[179.0, 834.0], [371.0, 834.0], [371.0, 861.0], [179.0, 861.0]], 'communication.', 0.9990134877817971], [[[179.0, 896.0], [1239.0, 896.0], [1239.0, 926.0], [179.0, 926.0]], 'The day-to-day trial team will be led by the Trial Manager (Mr Alvin Richards-Belle) and', 0.9914614084092054], [[[176.0, 957.0], [1299.0, 958.0], [1299.0, 988.0], [176.0, 987.0]], 'Unit co-investigators (Professor Kathy Rowan, Professor David Harrison, Dr Doug Gould, Dr', 0.995253452424253], [[[176.0, 1078.0], [629.0, 1080.0], [628.0, 1110.0], [176.0, 1108.0]], '7.3 Trial Steering Committee (TSC)', 0.9918702227227828], [[[176.0, 1142.0], [1253.0, 1142.0], [1253.0, 1172.0], [176.0, 1172.0]], 'A TSC will be established in line with the latest NIHR HTA guidelines (i.e. consist of 75%', 0.9644297997156779], [[[174.0, 1204.0], [1330.0, 1204.0], [1330.0, 1236.0], [174.0, 1236.0]], 'for overall supervision on behalf of the Sponsor and Funder and will ensure that it is conducted', 0.9902304435769717], [[[177.0, 1269.0], [1216.0, 1269.0], [1216.0, 1298.0], [177.0, 1298.0]], 'comprise the Lead Investigators (Professor Daniel Martin and Mr Paul Mouncey) plus', 0.9868347572117318], [[[175.0, 1298.0], [1334.0, 1299.0], [1334.0, 1332.0], [175.0, 1331.0]], 'independent members (including a patient and public involvement (PPl) representative(s)). The', 0.9943443620076744], [[[175.0, 1330.0], [1266.0, 1332.0], [1266.0, 1362.0], [175.0, 1360.0]], 'first TSC meeting will be held prior to the start of patient recruitment, the second following', 0.9872533051257438], [[[176.0, 1363.0], [1336.0, 1364.0], [1336.0, 1394.0], [176.0, 1393.0]], 'completion of the internal pilot and then at any other time determined by the independent Chair,', 0.9934287182986736], [[[177.0, 1394.0], [428.0, 1397.0], [428.0, 1427.0], [176.0, 1424.0]], 'but at least annually.', 0.9913637909022245], [[[175.0, 1450.0], [834.0, 1452.0], [834.0, 1482.0], [175.0, 1480.0]], '7.4 Data Monitoring and Ethics Committee (DMEC)', 0.9934941872637323], [[[178.0, 1517.0], [1228.0, 1517.0], [1228.0, 1543.0], [178.0, 1543.0]], 'AnindependentDMECwillbeset-uptomonitorrecruitmentandretention,intervention', 0.99432164994446], [[[178.0, 1547.0], [1293.0, 1547.0], [1293.0, 1577.0], [178.0, 1577.0]], 'adherence, separation and patient safety. Meetings will take place immediately prior to TSC', 0.989669436281854], [[[177.0, 1581.0], [297.0, 1581.0], [297.0, 1608.0], [177.0, 1608.0]], 'meetings.', 0.9991026322046915], [[[177.0, 1667.0], [686.0, 1667.0], [686.0, 1697.0], [177.0, 1697.0]], '8. Ethics, approvals and dissemination', 0.9983847549087123], [[[177.0, 1722.0], [472.0, 1725.0], [472.0, 1755.0], [177.0, 1752.0]], '8.1 Ethical compliance', 0.9958629255945032], [[[202.0, 1864.0], [786.0, 1864.0], [786.0, 1893.0], [202.0, 1893.0]], 'UK-ROX Trial Protocol v1.1, 14 December 2020', 0.9863821037790992], [[[1297.0, 1863.0], [1332.0, 1863.0], [1332.0, 1893.0], [1297.0, 1893.0]], '32', 0.9997656941413879]]
